abstract: >-
  An independent audit of the headline numbers in CyberChainBench
  (arXiv:2606.26216): 43.7% exploitation and 23.4% patching. The numbers
  reproduce from the public release (541 case files, patch subset of exactly
  94 cases), but they are different estimands, a clamped continuous score
  against a binary conjunction, so they do not form a difficulty ratio. No
  model is run and nothing is spent; every number is transcribed from the
  paper or derived from the published case files.
